I'm not even saying anything.

00:04:12.619 --> 00:04:13.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
She can just feel frustration
coming.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.455
-Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.
-Like, is everything all right?

00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:19.592
I'm like, "It's not going great
with the onesie right now."

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:20.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's nice.
At least you explain it.

00:04:20.927 --> 00:04:22.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just go, "Yeah!"
-Yeah.

00:04:22.395 --> 00:04:24.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Is everything all right?"
"Yeah!"

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:25.732 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-When you walk over

00:04:25.732 --> 00:04:28.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
and there's a new childproof
lock on something,

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:29.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
