you've seen it.

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:32.338
And you get over and like you
immediately get flop sweat,

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:33.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
because you're, like,
"I have do be an adult."

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:35.041
-And then "Mission: Impossible"
starts playing.

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:36.843 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like -- [ Imitating
"Mission: Impossible" theme ]

00:04:36.843 --> 00:04:39.379
-Because you're like, "I need to
be able to figure this out

00:04:39.379 --> 00:04:41.914
in 20 seconds, or else I'm going
to be shamed for the next year."

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:43.783
-But you're also going up to it
with a task

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:44.651 line:92%
because your wife will be like,

00:04:44.651 --> 00:04:45.918 size:78% position:39%
"Hey, can you go down
and grab that thing?"

00:04:45.918 --> 00:04:48.655 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're like, "Yeah, yeah,
totally. Oh, my God.

00:04:48.655 --> 00:04:50.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, my God,
do you pull it then push it?

00:04:50.823 --> 00:04:52.892 line:92%
Do you talk to it then pull it?"

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:55.094
Do you have to play "Twinkle,
Twinkle" and then it opens?

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:57.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
How does it happen?
How does it work?

00:04:57.096 --> 00:04:59.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your beautiful wife,
Emily Blunt,

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:01.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
