00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:03.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-So that's very exciting.

00:05:03.336 --> 00:05:04.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's what this beard's for,
yes.

00:05:04.604 --> 00:05:06.873
It's not just depression.
-It's a good beard, though.

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:07.407 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thank you.

00:05:07.407 --> 00:05:10.076
-That's not a depression beard,
because it's like very --

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:12.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's nice and, like, trimmed.
-Thank you, yes.

00:05:12.745 --> 00:05:13.513 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I wrote a script.

00:05:13.513 --> 00:05:16.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
I rewrote a script these guys
